  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I will greatly multiply thy sorrow and thy conception, Gen. 3:16 (Moses 4:22). cause sorrow of heart, Lev. 26:16. Lord shall give thee … sorrow of mind, Deut. 28:65. Many sorrows shall be to the wicked, Ps. 32:10. brought low through oppression, affliction, and sorrow, Ps. 107:39. Even in laughter the heart is sorrowful, Prov. 14:13. by sorrow of the heart the spirit is broken, Prov. 15:13. he that increaseth knowledge increaseth sorrow, Eccl. 1:18. remove sorrow from thy heart, Eccl. 11:10. there shall be heaviness and sorrow, Isa. 29:2. sorrow and sighing shall flee away, Isa. 35:10 (51:11). lie down in sorrow, Isa. 50:11 (D&C 133:70). man of sorrows, and acquainted with grief, Isa. 53:3 (Mosiah 14:3). came I forth … to see labour and sorrow, Jer. 20:18. they shall not sorrow any more, Jer. 31:12. anguish and sorrows have taken her, Jer. 49:24. sorrows of a travailing woman, Hosea 13:13. I will gather them that are sorrowful, Zeph. 3:18.",
